ce-y-3\"><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">May Áo Thun</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Chuyên may áo thun oversize, form boxy, slimfit, baby tee, polo... Đáp ứng đa dạng định lượng vải từ 180 GSM đến 350 GSM.</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Vải Cotton 100%, Cotton 2C/4C, CVC, TC</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Bo cổ dệt riêng, xử lý chống bai nhão</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">In lụa, DTG, thêu vi tính độ nét cao</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 pt-0\"><a href=\"/dich-vu/may-ao-thun\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 cursor-pointer w-full bg-transparent text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 active:translate-y-0.5 text-xs px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl gap-1.5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider \"><span>XEM CHI TIẾT &amp; BÁO GIÁ</span></a></div></article><article class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-200 hover:border-blue-900 hover:shadow-md group\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-slate-200\"><img alt=\"May Áo Sơ Mi\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596755094514-f87e34085b2c?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\"></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">May Áo Sơ Mi</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">May áo sơ mi Oxford, sơ mi lụa, modal, linen, kaki mỏng. Đường may mí 1mm sắc sảo, form dáng chuẩn công sở lẫn streetwear.</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Cổ áo keo ép nhiệt không phồng rộp</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">May mí cuộn sườn kỹ thuật cao</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><span class=\"line-clamp-1\">Nút áo khắc laser thương hiệu</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 pt-0\"><a href=\"/dich-vu#so-mi\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-150 cursor-pointer w-full bg-transparent text-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 active:translate-y-0.5 text-xs px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl gap-1.5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider \"><span>XEM CHI TIẾT &amp; BÁO GIÁ</span></a></div></article><article class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between transition-all duration-200 hover:border-blue-900 hover:shadow-md group\"><div><div class=\"relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden bg-slate-200\"><img alt=\"May Quần\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1624378439575-d8705ad7ae80?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=800&amp;q=80\"></div><div class=\"p-5 sm:p-6 space-y-3\"><h3 class=\"text-base sm:text-lg font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">May Quần</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Gia công quần short, quần dài kaki, jeans denim 12oz, quần túi hộp cargo pants, quần dù gió dù nhăn và nỉ da cá.</p><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-slate-200/80\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs text-slate-700\"><sp