pointer  bg-transparent text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-100 border-transparent text-xs px-3.5 py-2 rounded-xl gap-1.5 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-900 hover:text-blue-950 font-bold shrink-0\"><span>Tìm hiểu chính sách sample →</span></a></div></div>\n[/ux_html]\n[/col]\n[/row]\n[/section]\n[section class=\"arden-react-page__section py-14 sm:py-18 bg-white border-b border-slate-200 \" id=\"process-section\"]\n[row width=\"full-width\" style=\"collapse\"]\n[col span=\"12\" padding=\"0px\"]\n[ux_html class=\"arden-react-page__content arden-react-page__content--6\"]\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full \"><div class=\"flex flex-col max-w-3xl space-y-2.5 text-center items-center mx-auto mb-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-xs bg-white text-blue-900 border border-blue-200\"><span>QUY TRÌNH CHUẨN ISO</span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-[1.2] text-slate-950\">6 BƯỚC SẢN XUẤT MINH BẠCH TẠI ARDEN</h2><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed font-normal max-w-2xl text-slate-600\">Quy trình kiểm soát chất lượng khép kín từ khâu tư vấn báo giá đến lúc giao hàng tận nơi cho đối tác thương hiệu.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">01</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Tiếp nhận yêu cầu</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Lắng nghe ý tưởng, tiếp nhận mẫu vẽ hoặc mẫu thật, số lượng và tiến độ.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">02</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Tư vấn &amp; Báo giá</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Tư vấn chất liệu vải phù hợp, tính toán định mức và gửi bảng báo giá tối ưu.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">03</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Làm rập &amp; May mẫu</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Ra rập vi tính, may mẫu thử nghiệm (3 - 7 ngày) gửi khách duyệt form dáng.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">04</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Duyệt mẫu</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Khách hàng duyệt mẫu thực tế, điều chỉnh chi tiết nếu cần và ký duyệt sản xuất.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">05</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Sản xuất hàng loạt</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Trải vải cắt tự động, tiến hành may ráp chuyền theo tiêu chuẩn kỹ thuật.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">06</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">In / Thêu</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Gia công in lụa, in DTG, thêu vi tính độ nét cao theo đúng vị trí thiết kế.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">07</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Kiểm tra QC 3 bước</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Kiểm tra thông số kích thước, đường kim mũi chỉ, cắt chỉ thừa, ủi phẳng.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">08</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Đóng gói chuẩn</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Gắn thẻ bài, nhãn mác, bọc túi zip/nilon, đóng thùng carton chống ẩm.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">09</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Giao hàng đúng hẹn</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Giao hàng tận nơi tại TP.HCM hoặc vận chuyển toàn quốc kèm biên bản giao nhận.</p></div></div></div>\n[/ux_html]\n[/col]\n[/row]\n[/section]\n[section class=\"arden-react-page__section py-14 sm:py-18 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-800 \"]\n[row width=\"full-width\" style=\"collapse\"]\n[col span=\"12\" padding=\"0px\"]\n[ux_html class=\"arden-react-page__content arden-react-page__content--7\"]\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-no