t-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">08</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Đóng gói chuẩn</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Gắn thẻ bài, nhãn mác, bọc túi zip/nilon, đóng thùng carton chống ẩm.</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-2xl p-6 relative group hover:border-blue-900 transition-all duration-200 shadow-xs hover:shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center shadow-xs\"></div><span class=\"text-xl font-black text-slate-300 group-hover:text-blue-900 transition-colors\">09</span></div><h3 class=\"text-sm sm:text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">Giao hàng đúng hẹn</h3><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed font-normal\">Giao hàng tận nơi tại TP.HCM hoặc vận chuyển toàn quốc kèm biên bản giao nhận.</p></div></div></div>\n[/ux_html]\n[/col]\n[/row]\n[/section]\n[section class=\"arden-react-page__section py-14 sm:py-18 relative overflow-hidden border-t border-b bg-slate-900 text-white border-slate-800 \"]\n[row width=\"full-width\" style=\"collapse\"]\n[col span=\"12\" padding=\"0px\"]\n[ux_html class=\"arden-react-page__content arden-react-page__content--7\"]\n<div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none bg-[radial-gradient(#38bdf8_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:24px_24px]\"></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full relative z-10\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider shadow-xs bg-slate-800/90 border border-blue-500/40 text-blue-300\"><span>ĐỒNG HÀNH CÙNG PHÁT TRIỂN THƯƠNG HIỆU LOCAL BRAND</span></div><h2 class=\"text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight leading-[1