ass=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-950 leading-tight\">CÂU HỎI THƯỜNG GẶP VỀ GIA CÔNG MAY MẶC</h1></div></div>\n[/ux_html]\n[/col]\n[/row]\n[/section]\n[section class=\"arden-react-page__section py-8 sm:py-10 transition-colors bg-slate-50 border-y border-slate-200 \" id=\"trust-bar\"]\n[row width=\"full-width\" style=\"collapse\"]\n[col span=\"12\" padding=\"0px\"]\n[ux_html class=\"arden-react-page__content arden-react-page__content--2\"]\n<div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 w-full \"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 sm:gap-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-slate-50/80 transition-colors group\"><div class=\"w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package-check w-5 h-5 text-blue-900\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16 16 2 2 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M21 10V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l2-1.14\"></path><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path><polyline points=\"3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" x2=\"12\" y1=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-1 min-w-0\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap\"><h3 class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm font-black uppercase tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-snug\">MOQ Chỉ Từ 30 Áo/Mẫu</h3><span class=\"text-&#91;10px&#93; font-bold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-blue-50 text-blue-900 border border-blue-200\">Linh hoạt</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed line-clamp-2\">Hỗ trợ Local Brand mới khởi nghiệp test thị trường an toàn không lo tồn kho.</p></div></div><div class=\"flex 